{
  "id": "unique-event-034",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#34 - the Axe\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,801,815]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As you enter the building, a young\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,815,850]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "woman stands before you. She is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,850,882]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "translucent, her hair buffeted by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,882,916]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "an eerie wind that you cannot feel.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,916,952]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The woman speaks. Her voice\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,952,980]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sends shivers down your spine.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,980,1011]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "She has a visible wound on neck.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1011,1044]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“He killed me with that axe and i\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1044,1078]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "cannot rest until the same\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1078,1105]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "happens to him.”  She points at a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1105,1139]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "large blood spattered axe in a dark\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1139,1175]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "corner of the room.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1175,1195]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may pick up the axe. The axe\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1195,1228]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will give you a +1 to attacks against\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1228,1266]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Polka-Dot-Dress Maniac if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1266,1300]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "meet him.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1300,1310]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#34. You may ignore this apparition, carrying on with your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1251,1310]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "investigation.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1310,1325]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5 A chilly wind blows. If you have a torch or candle, the wind will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1325,1393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "blow it out until the end of your next encounter.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1393,1443]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1443,1445]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You stumble upon a pool of yellow goo in the middle of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1445,1504]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "road. If you have a jar or bottle, you may pick up some, in case\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1504,1569]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-034:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "it may be useful later.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1569,1592]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    92,
    97
  ]
}
